? The University of Miami is the perfect place for you. Explore the unique reasons why our graduate programs are tailor-made for students like you:\nDiverse Program Offerings:\nChoose from over 15+ graduate programs designed to meet the unique needs of the public health field.\nInterdisciplinary Opportunities: Seamlessly integrate knowledge from various fields for a comprehensive educational experience.\nGlobal Student Network:\nConnect with a vibrant community of international students who share similar aspirations.\nCultural Inclusivity: Embrace a campus and city culture that celebrates diversity and fosters cross-cultural understanding.\nInternship Programs:\nForge real-world connections through our extensive network of industry partners and opportunities presented by our Office of Career Services.\nPractical Experience: Gain hands-on experience that enhances your employability on a global scale.\nReady to apply?\nWe can\u2019t wait to welcome you to the University of Miami, as an international applicant, students are required to submit additional materials. Please find our International Prospective Student Application Checklist below:\nComplete SOPHAS application\n3 letters of recommendation\nResume/Curriculum Vitae\nPersonal Statement/Statement of Purpose\nAll Official Transcripts\nForeign Evaluation\nEnglish Proficiency Exam Scores\nTest Scores (Required for the PhD in Epidemiology and Biostatistics programs)\nTop\nUniversity of Miami\nCoral Gables, FL 33124\n305-284-2211\nDepartment of Public Health Sciences\n1120 NW 14th Street, CRB 919\nMiami,\nFL\n33136\n305-243-8331\n305-243-8331\nResources\nAbout UM\nmyUM\nCaneLink\nAcademic Calendar\nCanvas/Blackboard\nUM Network\nAlumni & Friends\nMedical Center\nHurricane Sports\nCareers\nVisit\nCampus Map\nParking & Transportation\nConnect\nsocial-facebook\nsocial-twitter\nsocial-youtube\nsocial-instagram\nsocial-flickr\nsocial-linkedin\nCopyright: 2026 University of Miami. All Rights Reserved.\nEmergency Information